==Trivia==
The illustration rare card features {{p|Eevee}} standing in a grove of eight different flowering plants and bushes, each one's color alluding to each of Eevee's [[Eeveelution|Evolutions]].

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SWSH Promo|Eevee|95}}, one of the {{TCG|SWSH Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Collect''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Movie VS Pack|Forina's Linoone|5}} from the {{TCG|Movie Commemoration VS Pack}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

